UUID: e9d5438f-8f73-4330-abd1-6e1b634bcc2a
Disposal of the heat pump (158 kg). Transport to WEEE dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology available on the market
